caption: Profile JSON schema
tags: $:/plugins/crosseye/json-convert-studio/usage/reference
title: $:/plugins/crosseye/json-convert-studio/usage/reference/schema
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

```
{
  "format":        1,                     ← optional, profile format version (absent means 1)
  "records":       string,                ← required, a single template token
  "normalize":     [ step, … ],           ← optional, reshapes the source first
  "tw-fields":     { name: binding, … },  ← required, must include "title"
  "custom-fields": { name: binding, … }   ← optional
}

binding := string                          (a template string; see Section 6)
step    := { "pivot": { "key"?: string, "value"?: string, "at"?: string } }
```
